ss exit verification in both paths.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"change-sites.1","ref":"change-sites","item":"change-sites","kind":"semantic","severity":"MED","premise":"The listed packaging change site is the script used by the normal build.","evidence":"The design names 'scripts/copy-assets.mjs', which is absent. package.json specifies 'build': 'tsc && node copy-assets.mjs'; the actual root copy-assets.mjs copies src/prompts and src/assets into out. [files: package.json, copy-assets.mjs]","action":"Correct the change site to root copy-assets.mjs and wire broker compilation and packaging into the actual build command.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"does-not-hold"},{"claimId":"change-sites.2","ref":"change-sites","item":"change-sites","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"The ownership refinement includes the existing PID/socket publishers and cleanup paths.","evidence":"Daemon lifecycle writes PID and clears both paths; RpcServer.listen removes the socket before binding, and close removes it after asynchronous close. CLI forced stop and shell forced stop also remove both paths. These sites are covered by section 3.3. Fatal handling delegates to exitRespectingStoreHealth and realEndDeps in shutdown.ts. [files: src/daemon/lifecycle.ts, src/daemon/server.ts, src/daemon/index.ts, src/daemon/fatal.ts, src/daemon/shutdown.ts, src/cli/services/daemon.ts, scripts/daemon-ctl.sh]","action":"Apply the guard through the shared shutdown dependencies as well as startup, server, CLI and shell paths.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"preserved-behaviour.1","ref":"preserved-behaviour","item":"preserved-behaviour","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"Store-health-aware self-termination, healthy graceful exit and shutdown reentrancy are existing behaviors the design preserves.","evidence":"createShutdown ignores repeated signals using 'if (started)'. Locks-lost shutdown skips queue/store close and calls endAfterStoreFailure; healthy shutdown drains the queue, closes stores and exits normally. shutdown-store-failure.test.ts asserts these sequences, including no process.exit on failed-store paths. [files: src/daemon/shutdown.ts, src/daemon/__tests__/shutdown-store-failure.test.ts]","action":"Keep these assertions while injecting watchdog readiness before cleanup.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"tests.1","ref":"tests","item":"tests","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"The proposed acceptance mapping contains regression checks for ac1–ac3 and an explicit manual evidence check for ac4.","evidence":"The proposed live-target-after-file-removal cases expose the actual waitForStop defect. Blocked-exit tests expose createShutdown's current reliance on an in-process timer/process.exit. Replacement tests exercise the existing numeric-PID signalling gap in signalVerifiedProcess. ac4 specifies controlled reproduction fields and a historical-cause caveat, without claiming automated proof. [files: src/cli/services/lifecycle.ts, src/daemon/shutdown.ts, src/shared/daemon-process.ts, src/cli/services/__tests__/daemon-stop.test.ts, docs/standalone/daemon-stop-must-wait-process-end-E20261013fd8d70c3/S001/TESTS.md]","action":"Implement these regression cases; keep manual ac4 acceptance separate from automated test success.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"holds"},{"claimId":"tests.2","ref":"tests","item":"tests","kind":"semantic","severity":"LOW","premise":"The proposed watchdog, stable-broker and investigation acceptance checks already have confirming repository evidence.","evidence":"Existing stop tests use the old StopDeps and a single fake PID. TESTS.md records only identity and run-file guard tests. The listed investigation document is absent from the story directory. No completed watchdog/broker validation or Darwin runtime evidence was found. Analyzer drill-down was attempted but failed with shaper-llm-unavailable caused by an invalid response schema; direct reads were used instead. [files: src/cli/services/__tests__/daemon-stop.test.ts, src/shared/daemon-process.ts, docs/standalone/daemon-stop-must-wait-process-end-E20261013fd8d70c3/S001/TESTS.md]","action":"Require the new disposable-process tests, platform validation and investigation document before accepting implementation; existing test results do not establish those outcomes.","fixability":"manual","outcome":"could-not-verify"}],"counts":{"high":0,"med":1,"low":6,"unverified":1},"template":"design-issue","reviewedAt":"2026-10-24T16:25:01.472Z","model":"cli-codex:gpt-6.1-sol","reviewedBy":"daemon"},"resolutions":{}}}}}
